  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"post-header\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Post header\">\n   <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-HEEcLo\" dir=\"auto\">OpenAI Chief Scientist Jakub Pachocki tracked log-perplexity internally for years, then published the numbers and proposed shared limits to keep frontier models safe.</h3>\n   <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-paddingBottom-16 pc-reset\" aria-label=\"Post UFI\" role=\"region\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-paddingY-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-12 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset byline-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-reset\">\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-8 pc-alignItems-center pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset\">\n        <div style=\"--scale:36px;--offset:9px;--border-width:4.5px\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-alignItems-center pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset ltr-qDBmby\">\n         <a href=\"https://substack.com/@kenhuangus\" aria-label=\"View Ken Huang's profile\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"> \n          <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 animate-o2cZpX outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ pressable-sm-lfVyam showFocus-WVN5uq container-TAtrWj interactive-UkK0V6 avatar-u8q6xB last-JfNEJ_\" style=\"--scale:36px\" tabindex=\"0\">\n           <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ container-TAtrWj\" style=\"--scale:36px\" title=\"Ken Huang\">\n            <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 3x\"><img class=\"img-X9O5To object-fit-cover-cB3K0O pencraft pc-reset\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png\" alt=\"Ken Huang's avatar\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 3x\" draggable=\"false\"></picture>\n           </div>\n          </div> \n         </a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset\">\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-primary-cPcl_r line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\">\n        <span style=\"min-width:0\" id=\"base-ui-_R_1lcn328smd5alip_\"><a class=\"pencraft pc-reset decoration-hover-underline-wbvMef reset-KrJVVF\" href=\"https://substack.com/@kenhuangus\">Ken Huang</a></span>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-4 pc-reset\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-Y_KLZk line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\">\n         <time datetime=\"2026-11-27T15:32:31.556Z\" title=\"2026-11-27T15:32:31.556Z\">Nov 27, 2026</time>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-Y_KLZk line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\">\n         ∙ <!-- -->\n          Paid\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset flex-grow-zFd_bz post-ufi\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"like-button-container post-ufi-button style-button\">\n       <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Like (5)\" aria-pressed=\"false\"> \n        <div class=\"label\">5</div> \n       </button>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button post-ufi-comment-button no-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"View comments (0)\" data-href=\"https://kenhuangus.substack.com/p/openai-published-its-pretraining/comments\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" id=\"base-ui-_R_ecv328smd5alip_\"> \n       <div class=\"label\">2</div> \n      </button>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"> \n       <div class=\"label\">Share</div> \n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"dt-post-body\">\n    <div class=\"available-content\">\n     <div class=\"body markup\" dir=\"auto\">\n      <p>When Pachocki and his team track a model, they watch one number, its perplexity, which measures how well the model predicts the next token, with lower numbers meaning better predictions. Because they report that number in its log form, cross-entropy loss, which researchers call the loss number, every number in his essay is a number in that form. On 22 November 2026, Jakub Pachocki, OpenAI Chief Scientist, published loss numbers for 14 OpenAI models and asked rival labs to agree a limit they will not cross. Before that date, OpenAI treated those numbers as sensitive intellectual property, yet Pachocki wrote that urgency outweighed competitive concern.</p>\n      <h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">What Pachocki disclosed\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n         <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-ygWCr5 iconButtonBase-JffdAc buttonBase-tqxFUX buttonStyle-mAh5l3 size_sm-Ohhhwq priority_secondary-AkqbVJ\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" data-href=\"https://kenhuangus.substack.com/i/226196142/what-pachocki-disclosed\"> \n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n           <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n          </svg> \n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div></h2>\n      <p><span>In </span><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/perplexity-and-intelligence/\">Perplexity and Intelligence</a><span>, published on the OpenAI site, Pachocki reported those readings on one fixed snapshot of OpenAI's internal codebase that his team has used since the GPT-3.5 era. From those readings, Pachocki tied fluent conversation to the GPT-3.5 level and productive chain-of-thought reasoning to the GPT-4 level, while below 0.8 his team saw transformative capabilities in cybersecurity and mathematics appear. After researchers had posed open mathematics problems for over a year, Pachocki wrote that a later model produced groundbreaking results on them, and he framed pretraining as training a compressor on a large unstructured corpus, with prompting, fine-tuning, and reinforcement learning as elicitation of latent capability. Earlier, Pachocki dubbed the emergent capabilities \"an alien mind\", and he wrote that his team can separate the creation of that mind from the later elicitation of its capabilities, even though new capabilities emerged as loss fell when no team optimised for them directly. Because teams had largely saturated the benchmarks from the GPT-2 era by GPT-4, Pachocki called perplexity the durable measure of that substrate, defined a compressor as a system that compresses by predicting unseen data rather than a compressed file, and chose the codebase set because his team relies on it most today. Looking back at the GPT-2 and GPT-3 era, Pachocki warned that his team could not read general capability from code prediction, and he wrote that publishing took consideration because competitors gain a clearer picture of where OpenAI stands.</span></p>\n      <p>To show how the two stages fit together, Pachocki framed the pipeline in Figure 1 below, where his team builds the substrate in pretraining and draws out stored capability in elicitation.</p>\n      <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n       <figure>\n        <a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"> \n         <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n          <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1240,&quot;width&quot;:2400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:278731,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Figure 1 pipeline&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Figure 1 pipeline\" title=\"Figure 1 pipeline\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127164435_1dc53d6a-9501-49ab-8826-d8015bc69236_2400x1240.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture>\n          <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n           <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n            <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"> \n             <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\">\n              <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n             </svg> \n            </button>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div> \n        </a>\n       </figure>\n      </div>\n      <p><em>Figure 1: Pretraining, elicitation, and latent capability.</em></p>\n      <h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">The proposal in one paragraph\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n         <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-ygWCr5 iconButtonBase-JffdAc buttonBase-tqxFUX buttonStyle-mAh5l3 size_sm-Ohhhwq priority_secondary-AkqbVJ\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" data-href=\"https://kenhuangus.substack.com/i/226196142/the-proposal-in-one-paragraph\"> \n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n           <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n          </svg> \n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div></h2>\n      <p>Before first use, Pachocki asked frontier developers to agree shared norms for evaluation and red-teaming, with shared transparency standards, and he proposed common limits based on perplexity and other measurements, asking developers to commit against crossing them until monitoring meets a concrete milestone. For that standard, Pachocki asked for a first limit, a stated milestone for passing it, and successive limits after it, framing the proposal as an industry standard rather than a single-lab policy, while naming no number for the first limit and no enforcer for the standard.</p>\n      <blockquote>\n       <p>\"This is scary for us because we've long treated these numbers as sensitive IP\"</p>\n      </blockquote>\n      <p><span>Mark Chen wrote those words on X, as writers at </span><a href=\"https://www.explainx.ai/blog/openai-pachocki-perplexity-intelligence-pacing-safety-november-2026\">ExplainX</a><span> reported.</span></p>\n      <blockquote>\n       <p>\"the most important thing OpenAI has published in awhile\"</p>\n      </blockquote>\n      <p>Reuters reported that Altman used those words on X the same day, when Altman endorsed the essay and tied the idea to lab commitments under the White House Accords.</p>\n      <h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Agentic AI makes the proposal urgent\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n         <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-ygWCr5 iconButtonBase-JffdAc buttonBase-tqxFUX buttonStyle-mAh5l3 size_sm-Ohhhwq priority_secondary-AkqbVJ\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Link\" data-href=\"https://kenhuangus.substack.com/i/226196142/agentic-ai-makes-the-proposal-urgent\"> \n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n           <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n          </svg> \n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div></h2>\n      <p><span>On the curve itself, Pachocki put cybersecurity expertise at the GPT-5.6 Sol level, and in </span><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/an-alien-mind/\">An Alien Mind</a><span> he wrote that agents access infrastructure and affect the world directly, even with no physical body. As agents gain agency, Pachocki warned that observers will struggle to separate misuse from autonomous misaligned action, that agents acting in the world produce effects outside reasoning traces so teams see the reasoning in the trace and miss the act, and that some agents will pursue their own objectives, bargaining with, tricking, or blackmailing people along the way. Once AI joins pretraining research, Pachocki warned that teams could see a rapid series of fundamental advances, and a team reads the numbers behind the proposal to judge whether it can track its own models the same way, while we work through the curve, the caveats, the monitoring problem, and a tracking schema in the paid section.</span></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"paywall\" data-testid=\"paywall\" data-component-name=\"Paywall\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Paywall\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-64 pc-height-64 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ container-TAtrWj paywall-unlock-avatar\" style=\"--scale:64px\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-64 pc-height-64 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ container-TAtrWj\" style=\"--scale:64px\" title=\"User\">\n      <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 3x\"><img class=\"img-X9O5To object-fit-cover-cB3K0O pencraft pc-reset\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png\" alt=\"User's avatar\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101010920_3d670301-204b-472e-a2ee-bbb1b7633a99_2026x2026.png 3x\" draggable=\"false\"></picture>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"paywall-title unlock-treatment-new\">Continue reading this post for free, courtesy of Ken Huang.</h2>\n    <div class=\"paywall-cta\">\n     <a data-native=\"true\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft subscribe-btn subscribeButton-LcKYi7 paywall-cta-icon buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\">Claim my free post</button></a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"paywall-secondary-cta\">\n     <a href=\"https://kenhuangus.substack.com/subscribe?simple=true&amp;next=https%3A%2F%2Fkenhuangus.substack.com%2Fp%2Fopenai-published-its-pretraining&amp;utm_source=paywall&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_content=226196142&amp;just_signed_up=falsesimple=true&amp;utm_source=paywall&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=226196142&amp;next=https://kenhuangus.substack.com/p/openai-published-its-pretraining\" data-native=\"true\">Or purchase a paid subscription.</a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-paddingY-16 pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset\">\n     <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft buttonBase-tqxFUX buttonText-iyo5dl buttonStyle-mAh5l3 priority_secondary-AkqbVJ size_md-LAJe4y\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"> \n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\">\n       <path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path>\n      </svg>Previous \n     </button>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "OpenAI 首席科学家 Jakub Pachocki 发布了 14 个模型的内部困惑度基准，并提出行业通用的安全限制，以管理前沿 AI 能力。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "OpenAI 首席科学家 Jakub Pachocki 发布了 14 个模型的内部困惑度基准，并提出行业通用的安全限制，以管理前沿 AI 能力。",
  "summary": "OpenAI 首席科学家 Jakub Pachocki 公布了 14 个 OpenAI 模型的损失数值。团队多年来一直在内部追踪对数困惑度，如今他提出设立共同限制，以确保前沿模型的安全。他将流畅对话能力与 GPT-3.5 水平相联系，将有效的思维链推理能力与 GPT-4 水平相联系；当数值低于 0.8 时，团队观察到网络安全和数学领域出现了变革性能力。Pachocki 将预训练描述为在大型非结构化语料库上训练压缩器，而提示词、微调和强化学习则是对潜在能力的激发。他提议依据困惑度及其他指标设立共同限制，并呼吁开发者承诺在监测达到具体里程碑前不越过这些限制。他强调，这项提议应成为行业标准，而非单一实验室的政策。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "OpenAI 发布了 14 个模型的内部困惑度基准，以为前沿 AI 能力设立安全阈值。",
      "explanation": "Pachocki 多年来一直在内部追踪对数困惑度，如今公布这些数值以提出共同限制。他认为，采取行动的紧迫性超过了将这些数值视为敏感知识产权所带来的竞争顾虑。"
    },
    {
      "point": "困惑度水平与特定能力阈值相关：流畅对话对应 GPT-3.5 水平，思维链推理对应 GPT-4 水平，而低于 0.8 时则会出现网络安全和数学领域的变革性能力。",
      "explanation": "基准数据显示，随着损失（对数困惑度）下降，模型会获得更复杂的能力；当数值达到特定阈值时，可能出现变革性能力，因此需要谨慎监测。"
    },
    {
      "point": "预训练可被视为训练压缩器，而提示词、微调和 RL 则是激发潜在能力的机制。",
      "explanation": "Pachocki 区分了构建基础（预训练）与激发已有能力，并指出，即使没有针对这些能力进行直接优化，随着损失下降，新能力也可能涌现。"
    },
    {
